// Granted by Heroes/Lux's SentryIncreaseFireRateSkillAction - permanently bakes into each spawned
// barrel's own Weapon.FireCooldown at spawn time (SpawnSentrySkillAction.ApplyFireRateUpgrade), same
// math WeaponPerkData/FireRateWeaponPerkData already uses for player weapon perks. Deliberately
// distinct from SentryFireRateAuraUpgrade, which instead buffs nearby ALLIES through a temporary
// Haste status effect (StatusEffectUtility.ApplyHaste) - a barrel has neither CharacterStats nor
// StatusEffects, and this is a permanent stat on the sentry's own guns, not a nearby buff.
//
// Begin-only, deliberately not paired with End - same reasoning as every other "configures what the
// skill does" upgrade this session: re-granting fresh (idempotent) every activation and never
// removing it means it's simply always there once picked, with nothing to race against.
component SentryFireRateUpgrade
{
    FP AttackSpeedMultiplier;
}
